# iris-vaapi: VA-API clients (Chromium's GPU process, mpv, FFmpeg) allocate the surfaces they import into EGL from
# the system DMA heap. Without access every surface falls back to memfd, which EGL cannot import (black video in
# Chromium). Give it to the video group and, through logind's uaccess ACL, to the user of the active seat; never
# world-writable. Ordered before 73-seat-late.rules, which applies the uaccess tag.
SUBSYSTEM=="dma_heap", KERNEL=="system", GROUP="video", MODE="0660", TAG+="uaccess"
